   "t": "have to carry it alone again--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1090,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1096,
   "src": "dca57a0f5392",
   "t": "I can't find the oars."
  },
  {
   "i": 1104,
   "src": "54916a17c3fa",
   "t": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1112,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1118,
   "src": "1d037f22b394",
   "t": "Look at that current."
  },
  {
   "i": 1121,
   "src": "c76a10ea2a2f",
   "t": "If we just float, we'll get stranded too."
  },
  {
   "i": 1129,
   "src": "dc79b9bddb14",
   "t": "W-well..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1132,
   "src": "c672cd9e627b",
   "t": "But how?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1137,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1144,
   "src": "bab9b0ac1905",
   "t": "-kun is... no, not that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1148,
   "src": "ce9e372ca388",
   "t": "-chan isn't a Power type, and..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1156,
   "src": "b0bdf345395a",
   "t": "What is it?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1161,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1167,
   "src": "4bc602321b59",
   "t": "If we had a Power-type {{medabot}} that's"
  },
  {
   "i": 1170,
   "src": "c8b0d1c496f0",
   "t": "good in water, that'd be reassuring."
  },
  {
   "i": 1178,
   "src": "2aa13b0ab9e5",
   "t": "Ah... so that's what..."
  }
 ]
